&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: .25in;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;12.&amp;#160;On May 8, 2026, following the retirement of Karen Haller, Chief Executive Officer of Great Basin, Justin L. Brown assumed the position of President and Chief Executive Officer of the entity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: .25in; tab-stops: .25in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in 5.0in 5.5in 6.0in 6.5in; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;13. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
